msgctxt "woh_home:206"
msgid ""
"You've been following the weird cult for weeks now.\n"
"\n"
"Barely surviving the encounter with the skin hag at the nursery, it's a race against time and you can't rest until our town is safe..."
msgstr ""
"Por semanas has estado siguiendo al extraño culto.\n"
"\n"
"A penas sobreviviste al encuentro con la anciana desollada en la guardería, es una carrera contra el tiempo y no puedes descansar hasta que la ciudad esté a salvo…"

