msgctxt "woh_ichi:1"
msgid ""
"Name: YUMIKO ICHIMURA\n"
"20 / FEMALE \n"
"When her twin brother suddenly disappeared during a family holiday, Yumiko swore to find him, no matter the cost..."
msgstr ""
"Nombre: YUMIKO ICHIMURA\n"
"20 / MUJER\n"
"Tras la desaparición de su hermano mellizo durante unas vacaciones familiares, Yumiko juró que lo encontraría, sin importar qué…"

