msgid "TREE-BEARER"
msgstr ""

#. Descripción de «TREE-BEARER» (woh_nana:573).
msgctxt "woh_nana:574"
msgid ""
"You spot a figure slowly climbing up the path. A whole tree is growing out of their back.\n"
"With each step they take, you grow weaker…"
msgstr ""

#. Parte de «TREE-BEARER» (woh_nana:573).
msgctxt "woh_nana:575"
msgid "A villager, cursed to carry the sacred tree up the mountain for eternity."
msgstr ""

#. Parte de «TREE-BEARER» (woh_nana:573).
msgctxt "woh_nana:576"
msgid "TREE-BEARER mutters an old prayer!"
msgstr ""

#. Parte de «TREE-BEARER» (woh_nana:573).
msgctxt "woh_nana:577"
msgid "TREE-BEARER swings a club at you!"
msgstr ""

#. Parte de «TREE-BEARER» (woh_nana:573).
msgctxt "woh_nana:578"
msgid "TREE-BEARER attacks you!"
msgstr ""

