msgid "SPINAL CENTIPEDE"
msgstr ""

#. Descripción de «SPINAL CENTIPEDE» (woh_nana:579).
msgctxt "woh_nana:580"
msgid "Something long and bone-white scurries past your leg, causing you to trip. As you try to get up, the thing slithers upright. It twitches, as if deciding whether your own spine will fit in."
msgstr ""

#. Parte de «SPINAL CENTIPEDE» (woh_nana:579).
msgctxt "woh_nana:581"
msgid "Made from the fused spines of unlucky victims, it’s looking for a new donor."
msgstr ""

#. Parte de «SPINAL CENTIPEDE» (woh_nana:579).
msgctxt "woh_nana:582"
msgid "SPINAL CENTIPEDE writhes toward you!"
msgstr ""

#. Parte de «SPINAL CENTIPEDE» (woh_nana:579).
msgctxt "woh_nana:583"
msgid "SPINAL CENTIPEDE slashes your shins!"
msgstr ""

#. Parte de «SPINAL CENTIPEDE» (woh_nana:579).
msgctxt "woh_nana:584"
msgid "You feel something pulling on your spine!"
msgstr ""

